    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "calling it cowardice doesn't make it feel any less logical though. you talk about fighting, but you aren't the one who has to live through the humiliation of being a ghost of your former self. if the best thing i can do for my art is to let it remain perfect in people's minds, why is it wrong to want to preserve that? isn't there a certain kind of grace in knowing when the story is actually finished?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
